      "title": "Team-event reports over $2,500 need an events cost center before approval",
      "summary": "When approval returns POLICY_HOLD POL-114, the fix is to allocate the report to CC-410 Events & Offsites and then approve. The rule is only shown in the report Policy panel, so the agent retried approval instead. Maya did it by hand in 58 seconds.",
